{"name": "张生记(丁香国际店)", "name_en": null, "match_restaurant_id": null, "brand_group": "张生记", "brand_confirmed": true, "scene": "正餐", "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "浙", "杭帮菜"]], "form": "Casual Dining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "ingredients": ["肉禽", "河鲜"], "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "special_tags": ["可预订", "包间"], "price_avg": 150, "price_range": "¥120-180", "tier": "中档", "district": "浦东新区", "address": "上海市浦东新区丁香路858号丁香国际商业中心F3层", "business_area": "联洋/丁香路", "lat": null, "lng": null, "coord_source": null, "phone": "02168583309 / 02168583307", "booking_method": "电话预订/大众点评", "signature_dishes": ["老鸭煲", "东坡肉", "龙井虾仁", "西湖醋鱼"], "status": "active", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "scores": {"objective": 72.0, "diner": 68.0, "taste": 72.0, "endorsement": 60.0, "soft_ad_penalty": 3.0, "total": 66.6}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "1998年，一锅老鸭煲牵动了多少上海人的胃。火腿肉、笋干、荷叶，用传统的砂锅小火慢慢熬三四个小时。几乎每个上海家庭都吃过这锅老鸭煲。", "dish": "老鸭煲", "source": "上海热线", "url": "https://m.online.sh.cn/hi/content/2016-12/12/content_8173613_2.htm", "date": "2016-12-12"}, {"quote": "招牌笋干老鸭煲，文火慢炖4小时的老鸭酥到骨头都软掉。鲜嫩笋干吸饱了金黄汤汁，喝一口直接鲜到天灵盖起飞。汤能泡三碗饭。", "dish": "笋干老鸭煲", "source": "携程笔记", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=146796693", "date": "2025-05-06"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "电话邦", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://www.dianhua.cn/dt/78a650e0c19145dbb4d82be0349a1291/26e4de95fae0af8e16e915e54fc20dfb"}], "negative_signals": ["老字号但近年扩张后品控争议", "商场店环境一般", "在线食客评价近年减少"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["1998年开业，上海家庭聚餐记忆", "丁香国际商场自然客流"]}, "sources": [{"title": "电话邦 张生记(丁香国际店)", "url": "https://www.dianhua.cn/dt/78a650e0c19145dbb4d82be0349a1291/26e4de95fae0af8e16e915e54fc20dfb", "type": "map"}, {"title": "上海热线 张生记老鸭煲", "url": "https://m.online.sh.cn/hi/content/2016-12/12/content_8173613_2.htm", "type": "news"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-23", "notes": "杭帮老字号，老鸭煲招牌。杭州张生记为母体(企查查可查)，上海丁香国际店为分店。另有徐汇店(肇嘉浜路446号伊泰利大厦2楼